# The foot of an artifact an ask links: a long question of two paragraphs on a narrow desk and an
# expanded one, and a question too tall for the desk.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies ask-artifact.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Juno
title "Returns page"
say "Show me the whole returns plan."
settle 10
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Show me the stores side by side."
settle 10
front Juno
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap ask-artifact-tall
front Wren
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap ask-artifact-narrow
click 1092,63
settle 3
snap ask-artifact-wide
